{"id":"en_princess-jane-s-daddy-makeover","title":"Princess Jane's Daddy Makeover","titleEn":"Princess Jane's Daddy Makeover","description":"Jane Young, Eldest Princess of the Vermilion Kingdom, is reborn on her fifteenth birthday into the body of an eight-year-old girl in the modern world. The child she now inhabits was the true heiress, secretly swapped at birth, who grew up neglected at home while a fake heiress took all her parents' affection and eventually left her to starve. Furious but smiling bitterly, Jane reflects that fathers are meant to give love and children to return filial devotion—so if this father has none to offer, she will simply find a new one. A father everyone despises, a worthless man? For the prestigious Eldest Princess, turning such a wastrel into a proper parent is child's play.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/princess-janes-daddy-makeover/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/princess-janes-daddy-makeover/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Cute Baby","Feel-Good","Heiress Drama","Heroine","Sweet Revenge","Urban"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6nws/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_princess-jane-s-daddy-makeover_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6nws/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_princess-jane-s-daddy-makeover_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6nws/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_princess-jane-s-daddy-makeover_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6nws/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embe